<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Code Solutions | Account Termination Message</title>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="entire">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Account Termination</h1>
      <br>
      <h3>Hi, <%= UserName %>. We're sorry to see you go.</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>It has come to our attention that you have violated some of the policies that
        were coherrent with Code Solutions.
        <br>
        Thank you for your time with us.
      </p>
      <br>
      <p>We're committed to providing a safe and enjoyable environment for our users, and we want to make sure that you feel heard and valued. If you have any questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to contact us.</p>
      <br>
      <p>Thank you for using code solutions, and we hope to see you again soon.</p>
      <br>
      <p>Regards,</p>
      <p>Code Solutions Team</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>